<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 24.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 24.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on December 23.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1   Prime Credit Tr     10.10	0.97</p>
<p>2   MT Leyshon Gold	9.96	2.51</p>
<p>3   Schroder Intl	  9.82	2.45</p>
<p>4   Villa World	    9.82	1.12</p>
<p>5   Prop Income Inv	9.50	1.07</p>
<p>6   BT Prop Trust	  9.49	1.72</p>
<p>7   Indu Property	  9.48	0.96</p>
<p>8   Gandel Retail Tr     9.07	0.86</p>
<p>9   Colonial Mutual	8.97	1.16</p>
<p>10  Aust Tour		8.93	0.84</p>
<p>11  Centro Prop	    8.86	2.20</p>
<p>12  Equitilink	     8.62	0.58</p>
<p>13  Barclays Mirvac	8.59	1.28</p>
<p>14  Advance Pro CB	 8.53	1.36</p>
<p>15  Gen Prop Tr	    8.52	2.36</p>
